    <bpmn2:subProcess id="_1FE7A87B-3338-4CE4-9745-6077E364D2C3" name="Farmstead">
      <bpmn2:documentation id="_i-30REikEfGDnvGeD6FIDw"><![CDATA[While exploring Velen's countryside near Lindenvale, or taking on The Fall of the House of Reardon contract, Geralt stumbles across a farmstead which is littered with booby traps. Search around and, as you approach to enter one of the buildings, you may hear a sound coming from the barn. Enter the barn and search for a ladder to get up to the loft, only to find Letho there. (25XP earned based on the Story and Swords! difficulty level)

Letho explains his situation - after the events that transpired at Loc Muinne, he has been on the run and in hiding ever since, as Emhyr now sees him as a threat due to being an "unnecessary" witness.

Suddenly, men approach the farmstead - clearly no ordinary lost peasants. Letho explains that only one man, a supposed friend, knew where he was, Louis. No matter your choice, he'll basically drag you into the fight so you have to help kill the headhunters. (50XP earned based on the Story and Swords! difficulty level)

Afterwards, Letho will mention hunting down Louis and you can choose to tag along or not. If you want more XP earned based on the Story and Swords! difficulty level and his help later during the Battle of Kaer Morhen, go with him and make sure to stay close. Otherwise, if you stray too far, the quest will complete and you'll never see him again. Meanwhile, despite his growls to "stick closer," you may loot all the corpses first if you want.]]></bpmn2:documentation>
      <bpmn2:extensionElements>
        <drools:metaData name="elementname">
          <drools:metaValue><![CDATA[Farmstead]]></drools:metaValue>
        </drools:metaData>
        <drools:onEntry-script scriptFormat="http://www.java.com/java">
          <drools:script><![CDATA[com.myspace.witcherquest.Quest q =
    (com.myspace.witcherquest.Quest) kcontext.getVariable("quest");

q.print("DEBUG (Entering FARMSTEAD): ");
]]></drools:script>
        </drools:onEntry-script>
        <drools:onExit-script scriptFormat="http://www.java.com/java">
          <drools:script><![CDATA[com.myspace.witcherquest.Quest q =
    (com.myspace.witcherquest.Quest) kcontext.getVariable("quest");

q.print("DEBUG (Exiting FARMSTEAD): ");
System.out.println("DEBUG (Exiting FARMSTEAD): Helping Letho: " + kcontext.getVariable("helpLetho"));
System.out.println("DEBUG (Exiting FARMSTEAD): Quest finished? " + kcontext.getVariable("finishQuest"));]]></drools:script>
        </drools:onExit-script>
      </bpmn2:extensionElements>
      <bpmn2:incoming>_4597F63C-382B-4F09-BF28-233646704914</bpmn2:incoming>
      <bpmn2:outgoing>_7E4DB9FC-535E-4B5A-9B4D-8D0684F4D2DE</bpmn2:outgoing>
